So I think the first step is to see if you can access the registration page. If you
cannot, then I'll send a msg to Carol to ask that you
(Diane. Note this msg being copied to other gsoc-r folk to see if others will get on
board.) are set as GCI mentor.

Then we need to fill in the form, and gather some projects. I think they need to be short
and very doable. I'd suggest things we
feel would take about a day of our time and not much more. If it turns out the teenagers
are good, they can do several. I'll see
if I can think of a few.

